# tail23 bomb chain v3: move the Cyclops away, morph, lay bombs, lift the ball out of the height
# band, place the Cyclops on the bombs, then let the machine run InMaxRange -> SelectTarget ->
# GetUp -> ShootBomb (polled with obj).
@f600 place u047b 140 205 -13.2
@f620 tp 148 213.3 -13.0
@f640 give morphBallBombs 1
@f660 press x 20
@f700 press a 10
@f730 press a 10
@f760 objs CBomb ; objs bomb
@f780 status
@f800 tp 148 211 -11
@f820 place u047b 148 213.3 -13.2
@f840 trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f860 obj u047b
@f1000 obj u047b
@f1100 trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f1200 obj u047b
@f1300 trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f1400 obj u047b
@f1500 trigcall u047b IsDizzy ; obj u047b
@f1600 obj u047b
@f1700 obj u047b
@f1800 status
